rvLHsWMaqV1jGqlc\"/><figcaption>4. 梳打水可清潔手機螢幕（Instagram截圖 / @kanden.jp）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"家居清潔大掃除｜梳打水原來可用來清潔家居！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250123/959156813344280576628179.jpeg/vP6X4M49Mh9bgURcDJU7N7SjErXZxg44XYNVh12DVYc\"/><figcaption>家居清潔大掃除｜梳打水原來可用來清潔家居！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"家居清潔大掃除｜梳打水原來可用來清潔家居！（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250123/959156803856240640168205.jpeg/IH-uGwkN0-9kOwLQpU2Ikc20vGkxyvqXENspqhDbKao\"/><figcaption>家居清潔大掃除｜梳打水原來可用來清潔家居！（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文經《風傳媒》授權轉載，原文：千萬別用酒精消毒馬桶！日主婦曝3大NG清潔方式「全家佈滿尿液細菌」，99％台灣人不知道】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T02:22:02.170497+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1674,"images":32,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:00:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T02:19:11.932920+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T02:19:11.932920+00:00","content_hash":"9c82acbf3c57d9f607358e9e36d244881afc83066cde802029239d2718bf0dc2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}